# Test: the compiled native le personality judges owned documentation claims
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# and a frozen local-registration source tree, returns structured answers,
# rejects row-only operators on document answers before reading the tree,
# and confines deterministic generated-file writes to isolated roots.
# The complete embedded YANG/RPC contract remains checked; independent
# documentation/publication gates still judge the complete live corpus.

option=timeout:value=900s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/le-docvalid-answers
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
